Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.87,0:00:39.62,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\c&HC6C0A1&}kizukeba mata anata wo omotte
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:45.81,ED2 Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,250)\c&HF6DCF8&}aenai hi ni wa tameiki bakari tsuite sugoshiteru
